<div class="panel-head"><h2>航段去向</h2><span class="{{ 'ok' if stages.ledger.balanced else 'bad' }}">{{ '件数已对平' if stages.ledger.balanced else '件数有差异' }}</span></div>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>航段</th><th>目的站</th><th>清单</th><th>已装</th><th>待证</th><th>未装</th><th>错装件</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for row in stages.ledger.rows %}<tr><td>{{ row.leg }}</td><td>{{ row.destination }}</td><td class="num">{{ row.manifest }}</td><td class="num">{{ row.loaded }}</td><td class="num">{{ row.pending }}</td><td class="num">{{ row.not_loaded }}</td><td class="num">{{ row.wrong_bags }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<div class="equation"><b>{{ ledger.manifest }}</b><span>清单件</span> = <b>{{ ledger.loaded }}</b><span>已装</span> + <b>{{ ledger.pending }}</b><span>待证</span> + <b>{{ ledger.not_loaded }}</b><span>未装</span></div>
<div class="panel-head"><h2>清舱交接结论</h2><span class="{{ 'ok' if stages.ledger.handover.all_ready else 'warn' }}">{{ stages.ledger.handover.ready }} 段可交接 · {{ stages.ledger.handover.blocked }} 段不可交接</span></div>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>航段</th><th>目的站</th><th>清单待证</th><th>清单外已装未撤</th><th>交接结论</th><th>阻断凭据</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for row in stages.ledger.handover.rows %}<tr><td>{{ row.leg }}</td><td>{{ row.destination }}</td><td class="num">{{ row.pending }}</td><td class="num">{{ row.unlisted_loaded }}</td><td><span class="{{ 'ok' if row.status == 'READY' else 'bad' }}">{{ row.conclusion }}</span></td><td>{% if row.blockers %}{% for item in row.blockers %}<span class="clip" title="{{ reasons[item.reason] }}">{{ item.tag }} · {{ reasons[item.reason] }}{% if not loop.last %} ｜ {% endif %}</span>{% endfor %}{% else %}<span class="neutral">全部钉死，可清舱</span>{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<p class="empty">窗外晚到撤下凭原航段凭据回放，续飞装机归续飞段；归档批次结论随原件固化，重跑不覆盖。</p>
